# Frontend CSS catalog

Compose from `/design/` (core tokens and components in `base.css`). Page-specific UI stays in scoped area CSS. `styleguide.css` is layout-only for that page.

Tokens live in `:root` in `base.css` only. Do not duplicate a utility or component in `base.css` and an area file. New CSS only when a class combo repeats or markup becomes unreadable. No inline layout/theme. Use `var(--...)`.

## Core classes

**Page:** `page` `page-narrow`

```html
<main class="page page-narrow">…</main>
```

**Panel:** `panel` plus optional `surface-soft` `stack-sm` `stack-md`

```html
<section class="panel stack-sm">…</section>
```

**Type:** `title-lg` `title-md` `title-sm` `text-sm` `text-muted` `fw-700`

**Layout:** `stack-xs`…`stack-lg` `gap-sm` `gap-md` `row-between` `row-center` `grid-3` `mt-*` `mb-*` `p-*` `m-0` `text-center` `w-100`

**Button:** `btn` plus `btn-primary` `btn-outline` `btn-success` `btn-warning` `btn-danger` `btn-danger-outline` `icon-btn` `link-btn`. Disabled via the `disabled` attribute.

```html
<button type="button" class="btn btn-primary w-100">Save</button>
```

**Form:** `form-stack` wrapping `label` + `form-control` (no Django Forms)

```html
<div class="form-stack">
  <label for="field-id">Label</label>
  <input id="field-id" type="text" class="form-control">
</div>
```

**Table:** `table-shell` > `table`. Optional `table-compact` (smaller font only; no column widths in core).

```html
<div class="table-shell">
  <table class="table">…</table>
</div>
```

**Modal:** `gainz-modal` `gainz-modal-content` `gainz-modal-close`

**Set modal / value picker:** `set-modal-fields-row` `set-modal-times` `set-modal-actions` `value-picker` `value-picker-window` `value-picker-list` `value-picker-item` `is-center` `is-near`

```html
<div class="set-modal-fields-row">
  <div class="value-picker" data-picker="weight">…</div>
  <span class="set-modal-times">X</span>
  <div class="value-picker" data-picker="reps">…</div>
</div>
```

**Exercise type:** `exercise-type-badge` `exercise-type-badge--primary` `--secondary` `--accessory`. Partial: `components/exercise_type_badge.html`.

**Dropdown:** `gainz-dropdown` `gainz-dropdown-full` `gainz-dropdown-menu` `gainz-dropdown-item` `gainz-dropdown-divider` `gainz-dropdown-empty`. JS: `toggleGainzDropdown`.

**Toggle:** `gainz-toggle-switch` `gainz-toggle-input` `gainz-toggle-slider`

```html
<label class="gainz-toggle-switch">
  <input type="checkbox" class="gainz-toggle-input">
  <span class="gainz-toggle-slider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
</label>
```

**Toast:** `gainz-toast` `gainz-toast-success` `gainz-toast-warning` `gainz-toast-danger` `gainz-toast-message` `gainz-toast-close` optional `gainz-toast-actions`. Live toasts go in `.toast-container` in `base.html`.

## Area CSS

Scope with a feature class (`workout-sets-table`). Do not target bare `.table` / `.btn` / `.table-compact` for one-page layout.

## Templates

No blank lines between HTML siblings. One blank line before each `{% block %}`. Partials stay compact.
